"cues": [
{
"block": "b1",
"t": 3.2,
"end": 11.558,
"text": "A common belief: when the model uses a tool, it sees everything inside it, the code, the old system, the database."
},
{
"block": "b1",
"t": 12.058,
"end": 16.041,
"text": "It does not. It sees one thing: its context window."
},
{
"block": "b1",
"t": 16.598,
"end": 22.101,
"text": "Let's fill it, part by part, with the real tokens from Emma's question."
},
{
"block": "b2",
"t": 22.851,
"end": 28.748,
"text": "First, the system prompt: who Emma is, today's date, and how to work."
},
{
"block": "b2",
"t": 29.248,
"end": 31.953,
"text": "654 tokens."
},
{
"block": "b3",
"t": 32.703,
"end": 39.111,
"text": "Next, the tool definitions: a name, a description and an input schema for each tool."
},
{
"block": "b3",
"t": 39.611,
"end": 42.362,
"text": "Two tools: 128 tokens."
},
{
"block": "b3",
"t": 42.862,
"end": 49.003,
"text": "All 16 tools: 1,555 tokens, sent on every call."
},
{
"block": "b4",
"t": 49.753,
"end": 53.142,
"text": "Then Emma's question: 17 tokens."
},
{
"block": "b4",
"t": 53.642,
"end": 62.988,
"text": "The model reads all 799, and answers with a tool call, not with words: check_stock, BAT-500."
},
{
"block": "b4",
"t": 63.488,
"end": 65.543,
"text": "23 tokens."
},
{
"block": "b5",
"t": 66.293,
"end": 69.822,
"text": "Now the tool runs, on the other side of this wall."
},
{
"block": "b5",
"t": 70.38,
"end": 76.963,
"text": "tool.py, four legacy services, the database, Emma's session and her password."
},
{
"block": "b5",
"t": 77.52,
"end": 79.54,
"text": "None of it enters the context."
},
{
"block": "b5",
"t": 80.097,
"end": 83.522,
"text": "The model cannot see past the wall."
},
{
"block": "b6",
"t": 84.272,
"end": 89.089,
"text": "One thing comes back through the slot: the JSON the tool returned."
},
{
"block": "b6",
"t": 89.589,
"end": 92.12,
"text": "229 tokens."
},
{
"block": "b6",
"t": 92.62,
"end": 98.529,
"text": "The 5,400 is in there, and it is all the model knows about Ledgerline."
},
{
"block": "b7",
"t": 99.279,
"end": 112.607,
"text": "The second call reads all 1,051 tokens again, and writes the answer in 57: Manchester main stores has 5,400 packs."
},
{
"block": "b8",
"t": 113.357,
"end": 118.569,
"text": "Now Emma's full order, on a prompt with no codes, and all 16 tools."
},
{
"block": "b8",
"t": 119.069,
"end": 124.653,
"text": "Every call re-sends the whole context, plus each new call and result."
},
{
"block": "b8",
"t": 125.153,
"end": 131.538,
"text": "One policy search returned 610 tokens, and it rides along on every later call."
},
{
"block": "b8",
"t": 132.038,
"end": 144.658,
"text": "Over eleven calls the context grows from 1,916 to 4,035 tokens: 34,984 read in all."
},
{
"block": "b9",
"t": 145.408,
"end": 148.043,
"text": "So the model never sees inside a tool."
},
{
"block": "b9",
"t": 148.543,
"end": 153.441,
"text": "It sees what you expose, the calls it makes, and what your tools return."
},
{
"block": "b9",
"t": 153.941,
"end": 155.091,
"text": "Write those well."
},
{
"block": "b9",
"t": 155.648,
"end": 157.343,
"text": "They are all it has."
}
]
}